{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 31, :comments ["<b>אף</b> — He used אף in the sense of ascending, as in: העלות אהרן את הנרות." "<b>במשמניהם</b> — The great ones of the camp and the rich who indulge in pleasure, as in: ומשמן בשרו ירזה." "<b>And he mentioned ובחורי</b> — because of the strength of their nature, and behold, their strength did not avail them when HaShem's wrath ascended upon them."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 78, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:35:09.478662538Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}